  "hash": 1002219198,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Firing generates Heat equal to the Heat Generated stat. Heat dissipates each second by the displayed Cooling Efficiency value. This works even while stowed.\n\nReaching 1000 Heat triggers Overheat, forcing a Manual Vent and preventing you from using the weapon until Heat drops to 150 or lower.\n\nStarting a Manual Vent at 875 Heat or higher doubles the Vent Rate.\n\n<primary/>Primary Ammo Balanced Heat Weapons intrinsically deal 20% increased direct damage to <link Elites, Minibosses, Bosses, and Vehicles [#CombatantClassifications] />.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-11-20T00:05:24.708Z",
      "updatedBy": "StardustD2"
    }
  },
